{"id":"mosstrosity","slug":"mosstrosity","name":"苔藓巨兽","english":"Mosstrosity","kind":"enemy","categoryKey":"bosses","dbKind":"reference","image":"./images/database/renders-thumb-mosstrosity.png","description":"","parameters":[["基础生命","2,400"],["基础伤害","35"],["韧性","1,200"],["灵魂","200"],["弱点","闪电 ×1.5"],["最高单次伤害","35"],["速度","300"]],"tables":[{"title":"Where you fight it","columns":["WHEN","QUEST","WHERE"],"rows":[["Dungeon boss room","End of the procedural dungeon","繁茂洞穴"]]},{"title":"Moves","columns":["移动","效果","基础伤害","类型"],"rows":[["近战 combo","Two lunging swings that each sweep a 150-degree arc in front of it、with a short forward dash just before each hit lands. Get behind it or well out of reach instead of sidestepping、and if the 秒ond swing misses、the heavy third hit never comes.","20",""],["近战 final","The third swing only follows when the 秒ond one connects、hitting for 30 with double the knockback of the first two. A long recovery follows it、the safest window to hit back in melee.","30",""],["Charge","Once you're out of swing range it winds up、then barrels at you for up to 3 秒onds with the strongest knockback in its kit. It turns very slowly mid-run、so sidestep late rather than running straight away.","25",""],["Body slam","The charge ends in a body slam that hits for 35 with 5 splash damage around the impact、and the hit can be sidestepped. The landing spot becomes a slowing moss patch that lasts 2.5 秒onds.","35",""],["Flower summon","It slams both fists into the ground for 15 damage around its hands、and half a 秒ond later three flowers erupt at your feet. Move off the spot at once: each flower bursts just over a 秒ond later into a large poison puddle、though at 20 health they can also be broken.","15","毒素"],["Plant projectile","At range it fires up to three volleys of seeds from its back (8、then 6、then 4)、each slower、shorter than the last、and every seed leaves a poison puddle where it lands. The seeds don't home、so keep strafing、then close in during the recovery after the last volley.","20","毒素"],["Flower trail","Flowers keep sprouting along its path as it moves、up to ten at a time. Get near one、it bursts into a poison puddle after just over a 秒ond、but each has only 20 health、so break the ones in your way.","15","毒素"],["Cube summon","With a roar it calls 5 to 11 Moss Cubes into the arena、never more than 15 alive at once. It tries this after a seed barrage or when nothing else is ready、and each summoned cube is worth 20 souls.","",""]]},{"title":"变种","columns":["形态","基础生命","基础伤害","韧性","灵魂"],"rows":[["基础形态","2,400","35","1,200","200"],["灵魂 Storm (unused)","700","35","700","200"]]},{"title":"弱点与抗性","columns":["属性","变化"],"rows":[["毒素伤害","-35%"],["闪电伤害","+50%"]]},{"title":"原生属性（定义值）","native":true,"note":"解包表中的直接定义值；继承、难度与战力缩放另行计算。","columns":["定义","参数","数值"],"rows":[["苔藓巨兽","毒素伤害抗性倍率","0.65"],["苔藓巨兽","闪电伤害抗性倍率","1.5"]]},{"title":"原生能力参数","native":true,"note":"保留能力的定义值与覆盖操作；未翻译的内部字段保留原名。","columns":["定义","能力","参数","数值","操作"],"rows":[["苔藓巨兽","Trail","最大目标距离","0","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Trail","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Trail","触发权重","100","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Trail","冷却时间","0","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Trail","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Left","最大目标距离","500","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Left","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Left","触发权重","100","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Left","冷却时间","4","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Left","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Right","最大目标距离","500","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Right","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Right","触发权重","100","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Right","冷却时间","0","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Right","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Final","最大目标距离","600","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Final","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Final","触发权重","100","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Final","冷却时间","0","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","Final","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","冲锋","最大目标距离","0","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","冲锋","最小目标距离","450","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","冲锋","触发权重","100","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","冲锋","冷却时间","18","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","冲锋","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","冲锋","每秒最大旋转角度","20","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","冲锋","攻击后最长持续时间","0.2","定义值"],["苔藓巨兽","冲锋","bUseInstantMaxSpeed","否","定义值"]